  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: Hey, does UPS ship any good music discs? All anyone listens to here is
        metal :(
  - sentences:
    - text: Oh hey, you're with UPS? I ordered some spare parts to my studio a while
        back and they never arrived.
  - sentences:
    - text: "You got a funny shaped head UPS guy\u2026. \u2026. \u2026. OH DID I
        SAY THAT OUT LOUD! I\u2019M SO SORRY!"
